cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this label-free dataset-building protocol, cite this artifact separately from the software."
title: "MinxiongHydroCast label-free radar dataset-building protocol"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Chang
    given-names: Chien-Hsun
version: 0.2.0
url: "https://github.com/KageRyo/MinxiongHydroCast/releases/tag/dataset-protocol-v0.2.0"
abstract: >-
  Source protocol, fixed radar-selected event split, source and frame provenance,
  public evidence metadata, and synthetic reconstruction fixtures. Prediction targets
  derive from future observed radar frames. Human weather and flood annotations are
  unavailable. Original official observations, private catalogs, tensors and model
  checkpoints are excluded. Historical acquisition and QPE limitations remain explicit.
  This artifact does not certify forecast readiness.
